      "en": "Waiqar's forces march north for Forthyn, where Xenith still occupies the ruins of Highmont Castle. Whatever he is seeking, he can't be allowed to find it…and it is high time someone gave the dragonlords their first true defeat in eight centuries. \n\nIt will take everything the companions have to return to Highmont Castle and defeat Levirax's most dangerous lieutenant. \n\nThe heroes must win this quest. If they lose, you must try again.",
